id: pm-github-uqjf
title: Require explicit delivery attribution before merged-PR closeout
description: "pm-ado issue 33 shows that PR 16 only reported the statement-coverage gap, yet closeout selected it before delivery PR 19 because the item was in progress and its canonical link appeared in the body. Require explicit delivery evidence and report ambiguous candidates without closing."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags[1]: changelog-unreleased
created_at: "2026-10-18T18:19:06.214Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-19T01:20:59.793Z"
author: codex-agent
comments[15]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-18T18:21:36.252Z",codex-agent,"Root cause confirmed: in_progress bypasses delivery declarations, and ascending PR selection chooses the earlier gap-reporting PR. https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ado/issues/33 compares https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ado/pull/16 with https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ado/pull/19. Neither body declares closure, so both must be reported without closing unless a canonical item-to-PR link supplies delivery evidence. A separate fix/closeout-explicit-delivery PR will retain all prior history."
  "2026-10-18T18:27:43.386Z",codex-agent,"Implemented explicit delivery declarations (closing canonical links, whole-line closing item ids or pm-github trailers, and exact PR URL metadata). The full selection is resolved before SDK writes; competing merged delivery claims receive ambiguous_delivery. Added minimal public title/body/commit fixtures from real pm-ado PRs 16 and 19. The real bodies contain only mentions; both are now refused until delivery is explicitly linked. Updated previous positive fixtures to declare delivery instead of relying on status."
  "2026-10-18T18:30:07.355Z",codex-agent,"Function-only behavioral revert: restored the old in_progress bypass in runCloseout while retaining both real-shape regression tests. Both tests fail: the earlier gap-reporting PR is accepted and the explicit PR 19 selection loses provenance. Restoring explicit attribution makes the linked four-case suite pass, including ambiguous-claim refusal and whole-line declarations. The package pins, source inventory and 100 percent thresholds remain unchanged."
  "2026-10-18T18:48:06.831Z",codex-agent,"PR https://github.com/unbraind/pm-github/pull/150 is open at 69ab7dec54bd1493e632d98dab5aa3b7f09a4fee. Fresh --no-local clone strict health passes with required merge drivers in an isolated home. The current full npm gate passes all 4 new real-shape attribution cases, including the additional foreign/unknown canonical-link boundary. Current-head function-only revert copies are being rechecked without mutating any running gate checkout. CodeQL and Semgrep pass; full runtime gates and Node 22/26 CI are still running."
  "2026-10-18T18:54:50.388Z",codex-agent,"CI Node 26 passed 897/897 tests with zero failures, skips or cancellations, then the unchanged exact branch gate correctly refused 99.96 percent. closeout.ts line 490 lacked the compact-report positive-close arm after former multi-PR success fixtures became ambiguity refusals. Added an assertion that a real single-delivery dry-run remains close in compact output; no production code or threshold change. Superseded local closeout gates were stopped to rerun the complete corrected test corpus."
  "2026-10-18T18:57:14.608Z",codex-agent,"Focused compact projection verification passed: node --test --test-name-pattern=\"dry-run plans same-repo\" test/closeout.test.ts, 1/1 with zero failures/skips. This preserves a valid single-delivery close action alongside individual refusals and routine skip counts; the exact branch gate will rerun without weakening its threshold. Current-head real-shape function-only revert copies failed 2/2, with zero test-load failures."
  "2026-10-18T21:13:13.683Z",codex-agent,"Code-head CI is green at b21ff5bdbdcfdab6c97b1204d73ff528b0f65745: Node 22 and 26 passed with exact 100/100/100/100 coverage over 14 authored modules; Node 22 reports 897/897 tests with zero skips or failures. CodeQL and Semgrep passed. Full local npm and Bun release checks are still running; no local completion is claimed yet. Automated reviewer approval is missing: Sourcery quota, CodeRabbit skipped review, and Greptile ended trial. CI: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-github/actions/runs/39156538670."
  "2026-10-18T22:13:39.500Z",codex-agent,"Full local npm run release:check and bun run release:check both exited 0 at code head b21ff5bdbdcfdab6c97b1204d73ff528b0f65745. Each passed 897/897 tests with zero failures, skips or cancellations and exact 100/100/100/100 over all 14 authored modules: 10471 lines and statements, 274 functions and 3187 branches, all covered. Typecheck, build, docstrings, lint, duplication, privacy, production audit, pack dry run, changelog check and publication-attestation checks passed at unchanged pins and thresholds. The linked real-shape suite passed 4/4 and the compact single-delivery case passed 1/1; reverting only the old in-progress bypass makes both real-shape regressions fail. GitHub independently confirms delivery PR 19 merged at 2026-10-08T01:19:51Z. PR 150 is separate from release PR 149; existing pm-ado PR 32 records remain untouched and need regeneration with explicit PR 19 evidence. Final receipt checks and final-head CI follow. No merge, release dispatch, tag or publication was performed."
  "2026-10-18T22:54:00.823Z",codex-agent,"Review round 1: new PR150 threads PRRT_kwDOTbN4pM6tvYM7 and PRRT_kwDOTbN4pM6tvYM- are confirmed. Whole-line delivery declarations currently accept newline whitespace between keyword and item id; ambiguity rewriting also changes mention-only rows when other PRs claim delivery. Restrict declarations to horizontal whitespace and rewrite only rows whose PR is in the existing claimant set. Extend real-SDK attribution scenarios with multiline negatives and two claimants plus a mention-only PR. Full npm/Bun gates and function-only revert proofs follow; threads remain unanswered and unresolved."
  "2026-10-18T22:55:26.292Z",codex-agent,"Review regressions pass 6/6 against real temporary SDK trackers. Function-only behavioral revert proofs: restoring only the old declaration regex in runCloseout makes the multiline-keyword/trailer scenario fail with ERR_ASSERTION (exit 1); removing only claimant PR membership from the ambiguity condition makes the two-claims-plus-mention scenario fail with ERR_ASSERTION (exit 1). Both retain current tests and other fixes. Same-line spaces/tabs, real linked PR19 chronology and single-delivery compact output remain covered. Typecheck, lint and docstrings pass. Full npm/Bun gates remain pending."
  "2026-10-18T23:32:52.582Z",codex-agent,"Review code-head CI is green at c9a29d199ac9982e842e28cfdf6b75fb014572c3: Node22 and Node26 each passed 899/899 Node tests, exact 100/100/100/100 over 14 authored modules, and 899 native Bun tests across 41 files. CodeQL and Semgrep passed; 60-second polling finished within 40 minutes. CI receipt: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-github/actions/runs/39174854340 . Both explicit local release checks remain in progress. Review threads have not been replied to or resolved."
  "2026-10-18T23:43:08.088Z",codex-agent,"The first concurrent Bun release-check attempt hit the existing startup-sensitive watchdog probe tracked by pm-github-sah1: test/bounded-cli.test.ts failed its /ready/ assertion because stdout was empty before the unchanged 500 ms child deadline. All six changed attribution scenarios passed in that attempt; both Node22/26 CI jobs passed all 899 tests and exact coverage. Stopped the already-failed execution (exit 143) to avoid spending resources on an invalid run; resulting cancellation diagnostics are not additional regressions. Isolated node --test test/bounded-cli.test.ts passes 2/2 unchanged. A complete Bun release-check rerun will run after the other local gates finish, with unchanged coverage thresholds, test/helper budgets and dependency pins. This reuses the existing follow-up instead of creating a duplicate."
  "2026-10-19T00:19:52.087Z",codex-agent,"The explicit npm run release:check completed with exit 0 at code head c9a29d199ac9982e842e28cfdf6b75fb014572c3: 899/899 tests, zero failures/skips/cancellations, exact 100/100/100/100 over 14 authored modules. Lines/statements 10472/10472; functions 274/274; branches 3187/3187. All remaining release-check stages passed. The complete bun run release:check rerun has now started after the other local gates finished, with unchanged test/helper budgets, thresholds, source scope and dependency pins. Earlier interrupted concurrent Bun results remain documented separately; no final Bun completion is claimed yet."
  "2026-10-19T00:50:27.912Z",codex-agent,"The complete unchanged Bun rerun has passed the 500 ms startup-watchdog control and all six real-SDK attribution scenarios, including both new review regressions. Remaining workflow acceptance and coverage aggregation are still in progress; no full Bun completion is claimed. The companion release PR149 is now complete at 7b61575b5e1a29ed929358f188456412f6b3b769 with both 903-test local gates, final Node22/26 CI and independent fresh-clone strict health/validation/privacy: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-github/actions/runs/39179989399 . This attribution branch stays separately verified; combined merge acceptance remains with the orchestrator."
  "2026-10-19T01:20:55.272Z",codex-agent,"Review round 1 full gates completed at code head c9a29d199ac9982e842e28cfdf6b75fb014572c3: npm run release:check and the complete bun run release:check rerun both exited 0. Each passed 899/899 tests, zero failures/skips/cancellations and exact 100/100/100/100 over 14 authored modules. Lines/statements 10472/10472; functions 274/274; branches npm 3187/3187 and Bun invocation 3185/3185. All stages passed with unchanged thresholds, source scope, dependency pins and helper/test budgets. The initial concurrent Bun attempt reproduced existing pm-github-sah1 /ready/ startup sensitivity and was stopped; the unchanged full rerun passed the 500 ms watchdog as well as all tests. The follow-up remains open. Focused attribution suite 6/6 and compact control 1/1 passed. Restoring only the old declaration regex makes the multiline regression fail; removing only claimant membership makes the two-claimants-plus-mention regression fail, both with ERR_ASSERTION. Same-line/tab declarations, real linked PR19 chronology and mention-only row fidelity remain intact. Completed receipts and initial-flake disclosure are in docs/explicit-closeout-attribution.md. Code-head CI: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-github/actions/runs/39174854340 . Receipt-head CI and independent fresh-clone strict health follow in the PR. No review-thread replies/resolutions or release actions occurred."
